.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-5.log:1338:    35	Define `FieldAttribution` with `subject: SubjectAttribution`, `derivation: DerivationKind`, source refs, confidence, and optional `SanitizedExplanation`. `ProvenanceBuilder::finalize<T: Serialize>` serializes the domain output to `serde_json::Value`, expands expected JSON-pointer leaf paths, applies any subtree helpers to concrete leaves, and rejects missing attribution before returning `AbilityOutput<T>`. Direct projections use `pass_through()` to auto-fill field attributions. LLM synthesis requires source refs. Declared confidence requires a sanitized explanation.
