.docs/plans/wave-W4/_prompts/_logs/DOS-5.log:7102:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:6721:.docs/ARCHITECTURE.md:61:Events — "EntityUpdated," "ClaimAsserted," "ClaimTrustChanged," "AbilityOutputChanged." Every signal has a typed propagation policy from a compile-time-checked registry. Durable invalidation jobs replace depth-limited-drop. Coalescing and rate limits keep the bus safe under load.
